<title>USA: World Airways Inc Q2 oper share falls.</title>
<headline>World Airways Inc Q2 oper share falls.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.50   profit	 $1.20</p>
<p> Net profit		 5,646     loss	14,059</p>
<p> Revs			81,928		   86,508</p>
